nodes.prompt:
Brand: {{brand.brand_name}} — {{brand.brand_summary}}
Voice: {{brand.voice_tone}}

Promise: {{inputs.promise}}
Steps: {{inputs.steps}}
CTA: {{inputs.cta}}

The video is two shots: 8 seconds over the real product UI, then 6 seconds on an end card. A single narrator speaks over both.

`demo_line` is spoken over the first shot: the promise and the steps, at most 18 words.
`cta_line` is spoken over the end card: the call to action, at most 12 words.

`end_card_prompt` is a still-image prompt for a clean vertical 9:16 end card in the brand's palette {{brand.facts.palette}}. Describe composition and colour only — no text rendering instructions.

`on_screen_text`: exactly 2 captions, at most 5 words each — one per shot.
